---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import SiteHeader from '../components/SiteHeader.astro';
import SiteFooter from '../components/SiteFooter.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="Privacy Policy — trulycompass.com"
	description="Privacy Policy for trulycompass.com. Learn how we handle your data. All compass and location calculations run entirely in your browser."
	keywords="privacy policy, online compass privacy, location privacy, browser compass, no data collection"
	canonical="https://trulycompass.com/privacy-policy/"
>
	<div class="relative min-h-screen flex flex-col overflow-x-hidden bg-canvas-soft">
		<SiteHeader current="compass" />
		<main id="main" class="flex-grow z-10 py-12 sm:py-16">
			<div class="content-grid max-w-3xl mx-auto prose prose-sm">
				<p class="font-mono text-xs uppercase text-muted tracking-widest">Last updated: August 2026</p>
				<h1 class="mt-4 text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink sm:text-4xl">Privacy Policy</h1>

				<h2 class="mt-10 text-lg font-semibold text-ink">1. Introduction</h2>
				<p class="mt-2 text-sm text-body leading-relaxed">
					trulycompass.com ("we," "our," or "us") is committed to protecting your privacy. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, and safeguard your information when you visit our website. Our core principle is simple: <strong>all calculations run in your browser. We do not collect, store, or transmit your location data to any server.</strong>
				</p>

				<h2 class="mt-8 text-lg font-semibold text-ink">2. Information We Collect</h2>
				<p class="mt-2 text-sm text-body leading-relaxed">
					We collect minimal information to operate and improve our service:
				</p>
				<ul class="mt-3 grid gap-2 text-sm text-body leading-relaxed">
					<li><strong>Device sensor data</strong> — Your device's magnetometer and orientation sensors are accessed only with your explicit permission and only within your browser. This data never leaves your device.</li>
					<li><strong>Geolocation data</strong> — When you grant location permission, your browser shares your coordinates with our JavaScript code. All location-based calculations (sun position, prayer times, qibla direction) happen locally in your browser. We never send your coordinates to our servers.</li>
					<li><strong>Anonymous usage data</strong> — We may use standard web analytics (e.g., server logs) to count page visits and track general usage patterns. This data is anonymized and cannot identify you personally.</li>
				</ul>

				<h2 class="mt-8 text-lg font-semibold text-ink">3. How We Use Your Information</h2>
				<p class="mt-2 text-sm text-body leading-relaxed">
					Any information processed is used solely for:
				</p>
				<ul class="mt-3 grid gap-2 text-sm text-body leading-relaxed">
					<li>Providing real-time compass, sun position, moon phase, prayer times, and navigation tools</li>
					<li>Improving website functionality and user experience</li>
					<li>Analyzing aggregated, anonymized traffic patterns</li>
				</ul>

				<h2 class="mt-8 text-lg font-semibold text-ink">4. Data Storage and Security</h2>
				<p class="mt-2 text-sm text-body leading-relaxed">
					We implement industry-standard security measures. However, the most important safeguard is our architecture: all sensitive computations involving your location, orientation, and personal data are performed client-side in your browser. We do not operate databases that store user profiles, location histories, or personal identifiers.
				</p>

				<h2 class="mt-8 text-lg font-semibold text-ink">5. Third-Party Services — Advertising</h2>
				<p class="mt-2 text-sm text-body leading-relaxed">
					We display advertisements through <strong>Google AdSense</strong>, a third-party advertising service operated by Google LLC. When you visit our website, Google AdSense and its partners may use cookies (including the <strong>DoubleClick DART cookie</strong>) and other similar technologies to serve you ads based on your prior visits to this and other websites. This allows Google and its partners to show personalized ads based on your browsing history.
				</p>
				<p class="mt-3 text-sm text-body leading-relaxed">
					Google's use of advertising cookies enables it and its partners to serve ads to users based on their visits to this site and/or other sites on the Internet. You may opt out of personalized advertising by visiting
					<a href="https://adssettings.google.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-ink underline hover:no-underline">Google Ad Settings</a>.
					For more information about how Google uses data when you use our website, please visit
					<a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/ads" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-ink underline hover:no-underline">Google's advertising page</a>
					and
					<a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-ink underline hover:no-underline">Google's Privacy Policy</a>.
				</p>
				<p class="mt-3 text-sm text-body leading-relaxed">
					These third-party ad networks have their own privacy policies. We do not control their tracking technologies. We recommend reviewing the privacy policies of any third-party services we link to.
				</p>

				<h2 class="mt-8 text-lg font-semibold text-ink">6. Google Analytics</h2>
				<p class="mt-2 text-sm text-body leading-relaxed">
					With your consent, we use <strong>Google Analytics</strong>, a web analytics service provided by Google LLC, to understand how visitors use our website. Google Analytics uses cookies and similar technologies to collect information about your interactions with our site, including pages visited, time spent, browser type, device type, and approximate geographic location (at city level). This information is aggregated and used to improve our content and user experience.
				</p>
				<p class="mt-3 text-sm text-body leading-relaxed">
					Google Analytics collects this data anonymously and does not link it to any personal identifiers. You can learn how Google handles data collected through Google Analytics at
					<a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-ink underline hover:no-underline">Google's Privacy Policy</a>.
					You can also opt out of Google Analytics by installing the
					<a href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-ink underline hover:no-underline">Google Analytics opt-out browser add-on</a>.
				</p>

				<h2 class="mt-8 text-lg font-semibold text-ink">7. Cookies</h2>
				<p class="mt-2 text-sm text-body leading-relaxed">
					We use the following types of cookies:
				</p>
				<ul class="mt-3 grid gap-2 text-sm text-body leading-relaxed">
					<li><strong>Essential cookies</strong> — A theme preference cookie (dark/light mode) and a cookie consent preference cookie, both stored locally in your browser.</li>
					<li><strong>Advertising cookies</strong> — Set by Google AdSense when you accept cookie consent. These are used to deliver and personalize ads, measure ad performance, and prevent fraud.</li>
					<li><strong>Analytics cookies</strong> — Set by Google Analytics when you accept cookie consent. These help us understand aggregate usage patterns.</li>
				</ul>
				<p class="mt-3 text-sm text-body leading-relaxed">
					Advertising and analytics cookies are only loaded after you explicitly accept cookie consent via the banner on your first visit. You can reject non-essential cookies, in which case Google AdSense and Google Analytics will not load. You can also disable cookies in your browser settings at any time, though some features may be affected.
				</p>

				<h2 class="mt-8 text-lg font-semibold text-ink">8. Children's Privacy</h2>
				<p class="mt-2 text-sm text-body leading-relaxed">
					Our services are not directed to children under 13. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children. If you believe a child has provided us with personal data, contact us and we will promptly remove it.
				</p>

				<h2 class="mt-8 text-lg font-semibold text-ink">9. Changes to This Policy</h2>
				<p class="mt-2 text-sm text-body leading-relaxed">
					We may update this Privacy Policy periodically. Changes will be posted on this page with an updated revision date. We encourage you to review this policy regularly.
				</p>

				<h2 class="mt-8 text-lg font-semibold text-ink">10. Contact</h2>
				<p class="mt-2 text-sm text-body leading-relaxed">
					If you have questions about this Privacy Policy, please <a href="/contact/" class="text-ink underline hover:no-underline">contact us</a>.
				</p>
			</div>
		</main>
		<SiteFooter />
	</div>
</Layout>
